{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "2f2ff74413e61d6d895d0d4008db0cc11aedefd0ef4cfeef19494d87c1f0e0d2", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん、\n丁度いいところに来ましたね～♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生，\n你来得正好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
