{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a07a5471e7a60896e511a29439ed8d8ae34abb863436e01187d5a665c50092f9", "ja": "ああ、読ませてもらったよ。\nその衣装、気に入ってくれたみたいだな！", "zh": "嗯，我看了。\n看来你好像很满意那套服装呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "fac06f2c17cfdc79608c5ef7b0e12fadee532e2d794bb6926365ae971c184905", "ja": "とても気に入りました～♪\n私にふさわしい衣装だと思いますよ～。", "zh": "我非常喜欢～♪\n我觉得是一套很配得上我的服装喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "a293422b0f8cff445b0a143e0e5bb18ecf25dd7811313708e87a428f47f6887d", "ja": "きっと子豚ちゃん達が喜んでくれるでしょう。\n{$P$}さん、ほめてあげますね～♪", "zh": "小猪们一定会很高兴吧。\n{$P$}先生，我要称赞你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "dedaf651deb25b6b58daa75fd088d48496be6c92b5a6c965d6382e38ebce00b1", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nそうか、ファンの喜びが、朋花の喜びなんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你。\n也对，粉丝的喜悦就是朋花的喜悦嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "7ec6963dcf965a5a3342538dd3946c95a48523389164862996d9edd161f75fde", "ja": "そうですよ～。子豚ちゃん達の声に応えるのが、\n聖母の務めですから～。", "zh": "没有错～因为回应小猪们的声音，\n是圣母的职责啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "4675500cd39a966660e36a400f563ea06ee2942208a915009d1d5b4703452b9c", "ja": "{$P$}さんには、\nちゃんとごほうびをあげないといけませんね～♪", "zh": "对于{$P$}先生，\n必须要好好奖赏才行呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b095dcd245224748bfeb1f97e8b471c8efc75a395faa6100f67a2d2b921865e8", "ja": "いや、ごほうびは別にいいよ。聖母じゃないけど、\nこれはプロデューサーの務めだから。", "zh": "不，不用特别给奖赏啦。\n虽然我不是圣母，但这是制作人的职责啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "5b524e623bf99dde9304c902af6b38c49eaf325b998b90f9de72c7143d8a4fc9", "ja": "あら……。\n聖母の慈愛を、拒否するつもりですか？", "zh": "哎呀……\n你打算拒绝圣母的慈爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "abe6190119e28676920eac1c3a0231e044f56dab1564a438695e0774942d31a7", "ja": "わ、わかりました。\nありがたくいただきます……。", "zh": "我、我知道了。\n我会心怀感谢地接受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
